Nearly 2 lakh #SocialMedia takedown orders in five months: How the system works and what users can do

@AshmitTejKumar 

https://t.co/dTyPxRVSFR

Over the past few days, at least 20 posts critical of the state government in Kerala have been blocked from the Facebook pages of @newsmalayalamtv, @reporter_tv, @kairalinews and @online_dbi.

While the notifications state that the posts have been blocked pursuant to the “legal requirements” under the Information Technology (Intermediary Guidelines and Digital Media Ethics Code) Rules, 2021, the Chief Minister of Kerala has denied ordering their removal. 

There have also been several instances across the country where @Meta has blocked content through its automated systems. With the Chief Minister denying having ordered these blockings, it remains unclear who initiated these takedowns. 

